{
	chapter.1EB3652FB98229F8.title: "Tips"
	chapter.623A76DB2D132D3C.title: "Welcome!"
	chapter.77FF51197A764877.title: "Notable Progression Changes"
	quest.083CB7D514FD9FCD.quest_desc: ["Pretty sure this is what's needed to slip by the bedrock and get into The Undergarden. Take the shape of the nether portal, but replace the obsidian with mossy stone bricks then use the catalyst instead of flint and steel."]
	quest.083CB7D514FD9FCD.quest_subtitle: "The Garden, but Under"
	quest.1DEE1501ACF3A373.quest_desc: ["If you're looking to craft some basic weapons, id recommend typing in @descendant and take a look at your options. Different tiers should offer different weapon types and armor variants."]
	quest.1DEE1501ACF3A373.title: "Descendant's Weaponry"
	quest.1EEEDC9A635D4A78.quest_desc: ["A more balanced diet will provide you with various buffs as a reward for eating more diverse foods. It shou;d not nerf you should you choose not to engage, nor will it make you an unkillable got just for eating different flavors of potato chip"]
	quest.1EEEDC9A635D4A78.quest_subtitle: "Eat your veggies "
	quest.265602BA997F07BE.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you've denied these poor creatures from reaching the afterlife by binding their soul to yours, the nether seems willing to let you come and go as you please. "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"This does not mean it's denizens will show any hospitality."
	]
	quest.3916CC55C1328E69.quest_desc: ["Well I'm not sure how we ended up here, but it looks like the lands we've, uh, landed in are stuck in a perpetual fall season. Also theres a bunch of litte... things running around. Monsters maybe? That could fit in my pocket? weird."]
	quest.3916CC55C1328E69.title: "How did we get here?"
	quest.3D86D53B7838BB5D.quest_desc: [
		"Imagine setting up an iron golem farm for unlimited iron in the big '25. "
		""
		"Jokes aside, I'd highy recommend using the create mod's method for unlimited iron. It's a lot cooler than the vanilla way (and probably doesn't violate any conventions)."
	]
	quest.3D86D53B7838BB5D.title: "Get a Load 'a this guy"
	quest.4939B472771DA1A9.quest_desc: [
		"Jokes aside, the you do actually have access to a minimap. This is where the atlas comes in!"
		""
		"While it contains all of the usual map mod functions you'd expect, this one takes either a hotbar slot or your hands slot, cuz you know, you're holding it."
		""
		"Also the atlas needs to be filled with paper in order to record new chunks. You can add new paper one at a time in a crafting window, but i would &ohighly&r recommend using a cartography table so that you can do it in bulk."
	]
	quest.4939B472771DA1A9.quest_subtitle: "No Xaero's? Time to give up"
	quest.4939B472771DA1A9.title: "Where's the minimap?"
	quest.5A4C1379DC3519B7.quest_desc: [
		"Tom's simple storage is the main storage mod in this pack. Connect the inventory connector to all of your storage blocks and you can access them all from the storage terminal."
		""
		"&8&oHint. If you're still pre-nether and looking for nether quartz, some of the nearby structures got a few soul fires goin. You can use this to bulk haunt some sand into soul sand, and wash it with the create mod for a chance at quartz!&r&r"
	]
	quest.5A4C1379DC3519B7.quest_subtitle: "More like AE Poo"
	quest.5AD206887D485272.quest_desc: [
		"You can parkour! Here's a few of the most useful moves you can use, but this is not an exhaustive list!"
		""
		"- Your normal minecraft sprint has been replaced with an enhanced one which is faster than vanilla sprinting. Trust me, you'll need the boost"
		""
		"- Holding right click at a block ledge within reach will allow you to grab on, and from there you can look up and jump to climb up, or look away to jump away"
		""
		"- Pressing R at the perfect time when landing from a fall greatly reduces your fall damage, and you do a sick roll"
		""
		"- Holding sprint at a 1 block high wall or fence will let you vault over it, and you do a sick move to boot"
		""
		"- Tapping R along with a direction does a dodge maneuver. Don't worry about dodging off a cliff, cuz you don't fall off blocks while doing it,"
		"kinda like sneaking. "
		""
		"It should be noted that all of these maneuvers (INCLUDING SPRINTING) consume stamina. Your initial stamina pool will feel lacking, but there should be ways of upgrading it in the future!"
	]
	quest.61AC57E0066CD0A6.quest_desc: ["The ramping xp costs of repairing at an anvil were kinda cringe, therefore the cost is now flat to encourage its use! You can even repair anvils by shift right clicking them with iron!"]
	quest.61AC57E0066CD0A6.quest_subtitle: "Anvil repairing is good now!"
	quest.69B34C7A7A264608.quest_desc: ["In this world, nighttime is &lDARK&r and you may find yourself struggling without a proper lightsource. Torches and lanterns are the go-to in the beginning, but more creative options exist as well."]
	quest.7251EA1C9A6557C3.quest_desc: [
		"Entering the nether cannot at first be done by simply lighting some funny rocks on fire (or lava casting for gen alpha). The forces which hold domain over this realm are picky in regards to the souls which can pass through. "
		""
		"Rumor has it that they absolutely love the Grongletts native to a massive network of caverns deep below bedrock known as The"
		"Undergarden. If you can find a way to \"flavor\" your soul to be like that of the Grongletts then you may be able to pass through."
		"{image:undergardendelight:item/gronglet_raw width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7251EA1C9A6557C3.quest_subtitle: "Welp, can't enter the nether. time to uninstall."
	quest.7251EA1C9A6557C3.title: "...The Neth- oh."
	reward.7479C1D453556471.title: "No speedrun ;sad;"
	task.0DE663F55BDE919F.title: "Rebirth of the - wait what?"
	task.181584BCA2B1295B.title: "HARDCORE PARKOUR"
	task.7C18988B613BE7BF.title: "A balanced diet"
}
